ranscript.aspx"},{"c":"CE 2019 Q3","e":"ce","d":"2019-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lori J. Ryerkerk","x":"There is -- there is a bucket in there, which is we worked very hard on energy and cost saving.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/22/celanese-corp-ce-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CE 2019 Q4","e":"ce","d":"2020-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lori J. Ryerkerk","x":"…we're targeting between $200 million and $250 million of gross productivity, so we can offset price increases, energy variations, etc., etc. But -- so we think that's very achievable, consistent with what we've been able to do in past, so $0.50 of gross -- of net productivity gets us to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/celanese-corp-ce-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CE 2019 Q4","e":"ce","d":"2020-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lori J. Ryerkerk","x":"I mean these are all things we constantly look at doing, which is how do we drive cost out, how do we improve efficiency, how do we improve utilization, just a few examples.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/celanese-corp-ce-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CE 2020 Q1","e":"ce","d":"2020-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lori J. Ryerkerk","x":"So we did have the raw material pass-through on that kind of 1/3 of the business that is more directly tied to raws.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/celanese-corp-ce-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CE 2020 Q1","e":"ce","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott A. Richardson","x":"We're focused on what we can do from near-term cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/celanese-corp-ce-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CE 2020 Q2","e":"ce","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lo