ad this year, things like not running our facilities as full and not having travel and those sorts of expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/celanese-corp-ce-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CE 2020 Q4","e":"ce","d":"2021-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ghansham Panjabi","x":"Yeah, we made a price increase in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/celanese-corp-ce-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CE 2020 Q4","e":"ce","d":"2021-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ghansham Panjabi","x":"We've made another price increase here in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/celanese-corp-ce-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CE 2021 Q1","e":"ce","d":"2021-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Sison","x":"And if so, what do you have in growth in EM and maybe cost savings, other areas to potentially offset the year-over-year delta in '22 versus '21?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/celanese-corp-ce-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CE 2021 Q2","e":"ce","d":"2021-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard","x":"How much of the price increase was to offset the cost -- higher cost?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/23/celanese-corporation-ce-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"CE 2021 Q2","e":"ce","d":"2021-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lori J. Ryerkerk","x":"So I would say that was the primary reason for the price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/23/celanese-corporation-ce-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"CE 2021 Q2","e":"ce","d":"2021-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lori J. Ryerkerk","x":"So those are cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/23/celanese-corporation-ce-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":